# The IP versions of the IdeaPad's Lucienne (1002:164c) that
# tools/amdgpu-renoir-specialize.py pins. One line per IP: `HWIP major.minor.rev`.
# An IP without a line stays a run-time value in the pinned copy.
# Source: the IP discovery table the device reports (gpu_amd_renoir 0.1.1
# stage 0, 2026-10-18), instance 0 of each IP. UVD_HWIP is also VCN_HWIP and
# JPEG_HWIP. external_rev_id 0x91 = RENOIR_A0, as the DC pin assumes.
GC_HWIP 9.3.0
HDP_HWIP 4.1.2
SDMA0_HWIP 4.1.2
MMHUB_HWIP 1.5.0
ATHUB_HWIP 1.5.0
NBIO_HWIP 2.5.0
MP0_HWIP 11.0.3
MP1_HWIP 12.0.0
UVD_HWIP 2.2.0
DF_HWIP 3.5.1
DCE_HWIP 2.1.0
OSSSYS_HWIP 4.3.0
SMUIO_HWIP 10.0.2
NBIF_HWIP 2.5.0
THM_HWIP 10.1.1
CLK_HWIP 10.0.2
UMC_HWIP 7.6.0
PCIE_HWIP 5.1.0
ISP_HWIP 2.1.0
